    <content:encoded>[caption id="attachment_2189" align="aligncenter" width="660"]&lt;a href="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_3692.jpg"&gt;&lt;img class="size-large wp-image-2189" src="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_3692.jpg?w=660" alt="San Juan Islands" width="660" height="495" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; San Juan Islands[/caption]

Adam and Colin have flown in &lt;a title="States We’ve Flown In" href="http://flyingsummers.com/states/"&gt;almost all fifty states&lt;/a&gt;, but Adam flies mostly in the Pacific Northwest and Colin flies mostly in Southern California. Once a year Colin &lt;a title="Crossing the Country" href="http://flyingsummers.com/crossing-the-country/"&gt;crosses the country&lt;/a&gt;.

&lt;a title="Airports Visited" href="http://flyingsummers.com/airports-visited-colin/"&gt;This map&lt;/a&gt; shows the airports that each has landed at (in a general aviation plane, it doesn't count to land in a commercial flight).

There are &lt;a title="Flights (Colin)" href="http://flyingsummers.com/flights-colin/"&gt;still a few flights&lt;/a&gt; Colin has on his wish list.

[caption id="attachment_2190" align="aligncenter" width="660"]&lt;a href="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4629.jpg"&gt;&lt;img class="size-large wp-image-2190" src="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4629.jpg?w=660" alt="Catalina Island, of the Southern California Coast" width="660" height="571" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Catalina Island, of the Southern California Coast[/caption]</content:encoded>
